Because of the trust, I feel disappointed; after all, it’s a product used for applying makeup to the face. It’s really better to buy it from a physical store and be willing to pay a higher price.
Because it's a flash sale, I didn't read the reviews; I've submitted my complaint to the National Administration for Industry and Commerce on behalf of the e-commerce platform we all use. Let's join forces in our fight!
