The filter cartridges I bought online from another store before worked well in terms of filtration performance. Even after the 28-day period had passed, using them for one or two more days didn’t result in any water scale buildup.
Since the quality of the products I’ve bought from Amazon has always been satisfactory, I decided to make a purchase there this time. It was my first time buying a water filter from Amazon. However, the experience wasn’t good at all: scale started forming on the filter quite early on, and even after using it for 28 days, there were still small, black carbon particles floating in the water. I really don’t know whether I should continue using it or just throw it away… I’m very frustrated!
It’s really a good deal after the discount is applied; it’s sad though when Amazon offers fake discounts.
