I’m not very satisfied with this purchase.
This is the second time I’ve purchased Pampers diapers from Amazon. I had bought a box of them when the baby was 2 months old, choosing the diapers with paper imported from Europe. I was quite satisfied with the first purchase experience; the baby used just one diaper throughout the night, and it indeed lasted for 12 hours without the need to change it.
But this time, I bought size L diapers. Each box contained 2 individually packaged packs. When I opened them, I noticed that the paper used was quite loose compared to the imported Pampers. After using them on my baby, they seemed fine: there were no leaks, and no signs of rashes or other issues.
But by the time we used the second pack of diapers, red rashes appeared on the inner sides of the baby’s thighs immediately after using them, and they haven’t gone away yet.
I suspect that the quality of the two packages in one box is not the same.
I don’t think I’ll continue making purchases in the future!
